# Addresses that have moved, as Cloudflare Pages reads them: the old address, where its page is now, 301.
# The bake refuses a line that leads to no page of the book.

# The pages the site showed before the book had any of its own.
/handler /handlers 301
/handler.md /handlers.md 301
/handler/* /handlers 301
/names / 301
/names.md /index.md 301
/names/* / 301
